<section class="story">
  <div class="container story__grid">
    <figure class="media media--4x3">
      {% img "assets/images/projects/tail/tail-structure-render.png", "Tail structure render" %}
    </figure>

    <div class="story__content">
      <h2 class="story__title" data-i18n="story.0.title">Design Intent</h2>
      <p class="story__text" data-i18n="story.0.text.0">
        The tail structure was developed around a set of design requirements where stiffness,
        load path clarity and manufacturability had to be balanced within a compact assembly.
      </p>
      <p class="story__text" data-i18n="story.0.text.1">
        The useful part of the project was not only reaching a final geometry, but also justifying why
 the chosen concept made sense under the given constraints.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="story story--reverse">
  <div class="container story__grid">
    <figure class="media media--16x9">
      {% img "assets/images/projects/tail/tail-structure-rib-3d-print.jpg", "Tail structure CAD detail" %}
    </figure>

    <div class="story__content">
      <h2 class="story__title" data-i18n="story.1.title">Engineering Tradeoffs</h2>
      <p class="story__text" data-i18n="story.1.text.0">
        We looked at how the structure would transfer loads, where material was actually needed, and
 which details would create unnecessary manufacturing difficulty.
      </p>
      <p class="story__text" data-i18n="story.1.text.1">
        That made the project a good exercise in defending design decisions rather than simply making
 the model look finished.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="story">
  <div class="container story__grid">
    <figure class="media media--4x3">
      {% img "assets/images/projects/tail/tail-aircraft-tail-installed.jpeg", "Tail structure render" %}
    </figure>

    <div class="story__content">
      <h2 class="story__title" data-i18n="story.2.title">To Actual Flight</h2>
      <p class="story__text" data-i18n="story.2.text.0">
        Close collaboration with the team was key to making the project come together.
      </p>
      <p class="story__text" data-i18n="story.2.text.1">
        Our tail section was the lightest design in the class and completed many successful flights, including being selected for the aircraft’s maiden flight.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

